      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T15:50:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They are doing things with using find_packages to get VulkanHeaders, and then looking at VulkanHeaders_VERSION, which returns \"\" for us, since we didn\u0027t have a version that matched the requirements. I don\u0027t know if this idiomatic CMake or not.",
