      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T15:50:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ok... I seriously cannot reproduce the issue what I was seeing now.\n\nThe vulkan-deps roll that pulled this I thought introduced this has been reverted at ToT, so I needed to check out an older hash (`1e7bfc3a35c47675b1a2711c162ccffb93977d4b~1`) to make sure the changes are there.\n\nPreviously `cmake -GNinja -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER_LAUNCHER\u003dccache -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_LAUNCHER\u003dccache -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS\u003d\"--gcc-install-dir\u003d/usr/lib/gcc/x86_64-linux-gnu/14\" -DTINT_BUILD_FUZZERS\u003dON -DTINT_BUILD_MESA\u003dON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE\u003dDebug ../.. \u0026\u0026 ninja` reproduced it consistently.\n\nBut now it doesn\u0027t, so I guess there was something subtly broken about my dev env?\n(I had been using a clean build directory and so forth, so I am really not sure what changed, other then my repo has been updated and sync and rolled back a few times, so I guess something was inconsistent in my repo, maybe? or maybe I had an older vulkan-deps roll and that had a transisent issue?)",
      "parentUuid": "79079c0a_d3fa2538",
